1
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,520
Let's go.

2
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,617
I'm so excited

3
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:53,700
to

4
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:00,810
be

5
00:01:00,893 --> 00:01:01,723
here.

6
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:33,397
We found this great restaurant
but didn't have any Digi-dollars,

7
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:36,097
so Digitamamon and I
got in a big argument.

8
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:39,437
Mimi's gorgeous friend from America,
Michael, offered to pay the check.

9
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:43,077
TK remembered that Digitamamon
was evil, but he swore he changed.

10
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:43,990
Yeah, right.

11
00:01:44,073 --> 00:01:45,657
I didn't believe it for a second.

12
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:48,197
He proved I was right,
too, when he attacked Mimi.

13
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,117
That's when I really let him have it.

14
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:54,417
The Digi-Egg of Sincerity found me
in Hawk-Mon Digivolve to Dishiri-Mon,

15
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,817
who destroyed
Digi-Tom-A-Mon's dark spiral.

16
00:01:56,900 --> 00:02:01,488
I'm glad to have a second Digi-Egg, but
I'm more excited to see Michael again.

17
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:05,090
Surimon!

18
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:06,960
Muget-cho!

19
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,760
Those kids can forget this area.

20
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:16,255
It's all yours, boss.

21
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:22,240
V-mon, hold still.

22
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,517
I still have to clean the
dirt off your toenails.

23
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:27,237
What are you doing, tap
dancing in a frying pan?

24
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:29,673
Quit wiggling around so much, would you?

25
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,720
I can't stop.

26
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,710
It tickles every time you...

27
00:02:32,793 --> 00:02:33,737
Let me at least wash under your arms.

28
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:34,917
You don't want to stink, do you?

29
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,177
Not under my arms, that's worse.

30
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:38,200
Can't I just be stinky? No way.

31
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:41,772
All my girlfriends will think
that stink's coming from me.

32
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:44,737
I'm supposed to be washing you.

33
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:45,650
Stop it.

34
00:02:45,733 --> 00:02:46,597
I'm going to bust a gun and read it.

35
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,798
Just get out of me.

36
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:56,820
It could be just my imagination,
but I think my family's gone nuts.

37
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,780
And now for news update.

38
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:01,200
Kenneth Ichijochi, the boy genius,

39
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:04,397
reported missing for the past two
months, has still not been found.

40
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:07,717
Police believe that he plotted his
own disappearance and are continuing

41
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:12,094
