49
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:33,759
My brother is getting on my nerves.

50
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,118
Let's go to the Digi-World tomorrow.

51
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:38,040
Yoli's brother needs us.

52
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:44,297
Make sure you all get lots of sleep.

53
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:46,968
You'll need it to fight
the Digimon Emperor.

54
00:03:47,980 --> 00:03:48,810
Hmm.

55
00:03:48,893 --> 00:03:50,720
Better snooze, or we'll lose.

56
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:56,257
Listen up, we got big trouble, you better
believe it, and it's really a dozy!

57
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,480
Shogun Tokomon!

58
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,257
Oh, he's probably wearing
those hair plugs again.

59
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:02,516
