124
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:42,090
So what?

125
00:07:42,173 --> 00:07:43,094
I was just practicing.

126
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:46,077
But this time, I'm going
to split some feathers.

127
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,657
If you think you're the
top ninja, think again.

128
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:49,570
Huh?

129
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:52,917
