number two on the food chain.

130
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,830
Come on!

131
00:07:53,913 --> 00:07:55,893
What birdbrain calls himself number one?

132
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,037
I'm afraid that has to be me.

133
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,061
Try him and see.

134
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:16,580
Digimon, the samurai of sincerity.

135
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:22,637
That's a pretty fancy move,
but I'm not afraid of you.

136
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,896
Wanna see some more?

137
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,846
How about this one, big shot?

138
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:34,340
Go, Cherrymon!

139
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:37,340
You're better than the movie! Huh?

140
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,021
Fungus Cruncher!

141
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:42,010
Peanut pollen!

142
