roids won't give me a break!

147
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:00,990
Whoa!

148
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:07,740
Come on, you can hide down here!

149
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,070
Huh?

150
00:09:10,153 --> 00:09:10,983
Geckomon?

151
00:09:11,066 --> 00:09:12,362
Hurry it up before they find ya!

152
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:14,480
We can escape down below!

153
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:18,200
A manhole cover!

154
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:21,537
I wasn't under the impression that
they had those things in ancient Japan.

155
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:23,977
You've got to realize that
this is the digital world.

156
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:25,277
Anything can happen here.

157
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,190
Who cares?

158
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,419
Quit talking and hustle down, okay?

159
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:29,777
Wind it up, Jureimon.

160
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,919
We've got to move.

161
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:33,857
Please, we've got a schedule to keep.

162
00:09:33,940 --> 00:09:35,469
Stop fighting and come on.

163
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,620
Sorry, but duty calls and so does Yolene.

164
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,608
We'll see each other again.

165
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:48,257
On behalf of the Gekomon, we thank
you from the bottom of our horns.

166
00:09:48,340 --> 00:09:50,297
If you hadn't shown up
and come through for us,

167
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:53,086
we'd still be servants
of the Digimon Emperor.

168
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:57,397
We appreciate what you did for
us to save our lives. Yeah.

169
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:00,537
You guys are a lot nicer
than the last time I saw you.

170
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,900
You sure were evil.

171
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:03,497
Not that I'm blaming you.

172
00:10:03,580 --> 00:10:06,337
I'd be pretty mean, too, if
I had a dark ring around me.

173
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:09,497
But that's all over with
now and we're friends again.

174
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,837
Tell me, is this where
you guys are living?

175
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,377
Down here beneath the ground?

176
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,797
I'm afraid that's true.

177
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,704
It's the only safe place to be.

178
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,937
Can you guys give us the inside scoop on

179
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:21,237
