where you are and he can find you again!

184
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:38,157
We don't want to be the
Digimon Emperor slaves again!

185
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,593
That was way too awful!

186
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,737
Shogun, Tokomon, do you
have any good ideas?

187
00:10:44,820 --> 00:10:45,650
We do!

188
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,305
That simple, my little friend!

189
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,957
Uh, what do you mean by that?

190
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,717
Mmm...

191
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,240
Mmm...

192
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,397
Mmm...

193
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,657
Well...

194
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,020
Mmm...

195
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,577
Mmm...

196
