That'll help.

198
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:17,275
I'm sorry, but snoozing on
the job's counterproductive!

199
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,180
He's yours, Master!

200
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:51,077
First, before we do anything else,
we have to destroy the Control Spire.

201
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,617
Aw, that's no problem at all.

202
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:54,517
All we have to do is armor Digivolve.

203
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,430
It's a cinch.

204
