You may think he just toots his horn,

222
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:46,917
but he can play a note so flat,
it'll flatten everything around him.

223
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,897
Gekko-Mond, I'm back the
way before you get...

224
00:12:48,980 --> 00:12:49,810
get down!

225
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,840
Let me help!

226
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:57,020
I can stop, I can't get
out of here! I watch out.

227
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:02,037
So, that's being controlled
by the Digimon Emperor!

228
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,120
We're in trouble!

229
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:06,253
He's big and obnoxious, but we like him!

230
00:13:06,340 --> 00:13:07,317
Can you do something?

231
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,230
Huh?

232
00:13:08,313 --> 00:13:09,537
Of course, just leave it to us!

233
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:10,640
TK, step it up!

234
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:12,585
They've got us all surrounded!

235
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:22,380
Come on, D-Mom, let's plant
these guys! I'm with ya!

236
