241
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:51,560
Dredamar, the storm of friendship!

242
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,412
Digimon Narlene Jumping!

243
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:56,280
Take him down, Patamon! Digimon Narlene!

244
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,457
Digimon Narlene!

245
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:00,680
I'm a Ritter Guide!

246
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:04,530
Digimon!

247
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:07,880
Kaderon Armor Digivolve to! Digimon!

